Bind Npc 19005 Zone 21
Quest 1119 "Certificating qualifications : proof of strength"
    Journal "Fill the exp 100% and show it to Makin"

Requires player level >= 83 and player reached level 83 at 100 percent and player rebirth level < 15

Rewards none

On offer
    Say "Man..  What should we do? You saw the start that fell at Logos? Something bad will happen!"
    Topic "Would not a way to stop this disaster?" do
        Say "We don't have any...   Does it mean that God has abandoned us?"
        Topic "So like this we must suffer the destruction?" do
            Say "...!! Yeah! That's what we can do."
            Topic "What is the way?" do
                Say "From the Logos Prophecy, moment like this... (turning pages) 3:6, it says.. Stars fall from the sky and there a knight, who is born again after enduring death, will save this world."
                Topic "Born again experiencing the death?" do
                    Say "Yes..  This hasn't happened but the time has come now."
                    Topic "What should I do?" do
                        Say "Reincarnation can be tried here now. But it's not easy. It'll be painful. But would you really like to reincarnate?"
                        Topic "I pledge allegiance to my country." do
                            Say "If that's what you wish for. But prove how strong you are."
                            Topic "What should I do?" do
                                Show quest "Become level 83 and Exp 100%."

On claimable
    Show quest "I knew you would be the one!! \n Now, there's the second mission."
